            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Inventory for 1 MJ heat from biogas, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 50 kW for a multi- family house with 2100 operating hours. Efficiency depends on use patterns such as input and output temperature and is here estimated at partial load (30% load) with efficiency 109.5 % (Hu);
