            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">undefined\n\n# Included processes\nIncluded are the biogas burning in a 50kW boiler which in turn includes fuel input, infrastructure (boiler), air and water emissions and electrictiy needed for operation. The inventory uses the average net efficiency for the type of boiler referring to the lower calorific value. The heat distribution ios not included</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
